  "definition": "Disciplinary Procedures",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-01-11",
  "historyNote": "#6109, eff 10-28-95; ss by #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-04 New. #8206, INTERIM, eff 11-18-04, EXPIRED: 5-17-05 New. #8583, eff 3-15-06; ss by #10361-B, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13854, eff 1-11-23",
